---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---
<BaseLayout title="The Work" description="Strategic briefs with measurable outcomes.">
  <section class="container section grid gap-8">
    <div class="reveal flex flex-col gap-4">
      <span class="kicker">The Briefs</span>
      <h1 class="serif text-4xl sm:text-5xl">Product marketing case studies in real estate tech.</h1>
      <p class="text-lg text-[color:var(--muted)] max-w-2xl">
        Each brief shows the problem, the insight, and the result. It's how I connect marketing,
        content, and product decisions.
      </p>
      <p class="text-sm text-[color:var(--muted)]">Tip: hover to highlight the insight.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="reveal grid sm:grid-cols-3 gap-4">
      <div class="p-4 rounded-2xl border border-[color:var(--line)] bg-[color:var(--bg-elev)] text-sm">
        Positioning and GTM for Zillow Showcase
      </div>
      <div class="p-4 rounded-2xl border border-[color:var(--line)] bg-[color:var(--bg-elev)] text-sm">
        The first "pizza tracker" for real estate with WFG
      </div>
      <div class="p-4 rounded-2xl border border-[color:var(--line)] bg-[color:var(--bg-elev)] text-sm">
        Video-first experience for Sotheby's International Realty
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="grid gap-6">
      <article class="group reveal border border-[color:var(--line)] rounded-2xl p-6 bg-[color:var(--bg-elev)]">
        <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-center md:justify-between gap-4">
          <h2 class="serif text-2xl">Positioning and GTM</h2>
          <span class="tag">Zillow Showcase</span>
        </div>
        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 mt-6 text-sm">
          <div>
            <p class="kicker">The Tension</p>
            <p class="mt-2 text-[color:var(--muted)]">
              A premium SaaS product needed a clear value story that sales and partners could repeat.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="relative">
            <p class="kicker">The Insight</p>
            <p class="mt-2 text-[color:var(--muted)] group-hover:text-[color:var(--text)] transition-colors">
              Lead with outcomes, then equip teams with messaging, content, and launch tools.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <p class="kicker">The Outcome</p>
            <p class="mt-2 text-[color:var(--muted)]">
              Clearer positioning, stronger sales enablement, and smoother product activation.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="group reveal border border-[color:var(--line)] rounded-2xl p-6 bg-[color:var(--bg-elev)]">
        <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-center md:justify-between gap-4">
          <h2 class="serif text-2xl">The First "Pizza Tracker"</h2>
          <span class="tag">WFG</span>
        </div>
        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 mt-6 text-sm">
          <div>
            <p class="kicker">The Tension</p>
            <p class="mt-2 text-[color:var(--muted)]">
              Buyers felt stuck after the offer went in, with no clear visibility.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <p class="kicker">The Insight</p>
            <p class="mt-2 text-[color:var(--muted)] group-hover:text-[color:var(--text)] transition-colors">
              Show every milestone in a simple MyHome dashboard with transparent status updates.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <p class="kicker">The Outcome</p>
            <p class="mt-2 text-[color:var(--muted)]">
              WFG's CTO named it Inman Innovator of the Year for transparency.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="group reveal border border-[color:var(--line)] rounded-2xl p-6 bg-[color:var(--bg-elev)]">
        <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-center md:justify-between gap-4">
          <h2 class="serif text-2xl">Video-First Experience</h2>
          <span class="tag">Sotheby's International Realty</span>
        </div>
        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 mt-6 text-sm">
          <div>
            <p class="kicker">The Tension</p>
            <p class="mt-2 text-[color:var(--muted)]">
              The site felt like a listing database, not a global luxury real estate brand.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <p class="kicker">The Insight</p>
            <p class="mt-2 text-[color:var(--muted)] group-hover:text-[color:var(--text)] transition-colors">
              Lead with story and video to showcase lifestyle, not just inventory.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <p class="kicker">The Outcome</p>
            <p class="mt-2 text-[color:var(--muted)]">
              A responsive, internationalized experience with 3D and multimedia that set a new
              standard for SIR.com.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>

    <div class="reveal mt-10">
      <span class="kicker">Additional Work</span>
      <p class="mt-3 text-base text-[color:var(--muted)] max-w-3xl">
        Selected work before Zillow:
      </p>
      <ul class="mt-4 grid gap-2 text-sm">
        <li>Led product strategy for Props (acquired by Realtor.com) and Nudge (acquired by WEST).</li>
        <li>Directed UX for the first global, video-centric Sotheby's International Realty experience.</li>
        <li>Led product development for Bright MLS Workspace used by 95,000+ subscribers.</li>
        <li>Built MyHome dashboard for WFG to make transactions transparent.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
